				<wikidot:authorName>The Pighead</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3242824</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>OK, so I wanted to do this before the release, but well, you cannot always get what you want.</p> <p>So, for explaining, I love collaborative works. I love music and I love rock-stars. So, I made a new snippet about some musicians and their &quot;ties&quot; with the abnormal world. And I also made a link with an excellent Explained SCP.</p> <p>This is my first contribution ever to a page of the SCP Wiki, so I admit that I'm a bit stressed, I don't know if it will stay or no&#8230; but, in all cases, I hope that you will like it !</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
