					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13003629#post-4486863</guid>
				<title>Author Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13003629/snippets-of-an-unveiled-world#post-4486863</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 02 Feb 2020 05:20:37 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Nykacolaquantum</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5187906</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I love epistolary fiction, collaborative works, and world-building. The Broken Masquerade canon is a goldmine for all of these.</p> <p>The initial entries were written by myself, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1586929224" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ifbench" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3227499&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1586929224" alt="IFBench" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3227499)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ifbench" >IFBench</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/westrin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2858989&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1586929224" alt="Westrin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2858989)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/westrin" >Westrin</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deadly-bread" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3988532&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1586929224" alt="Deadly Bread" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3988532)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deadly-bread" >Deadly Bread</a></span>. Now we are opening it for anyone else who wants to add to it.</p> <p><tt>Contributing rules:</tt></p> <ul> <li><tt>Keep the format epistolary.</tt></li> <li><tt>Entries must be at least 25 words long.</tt></li> <li><tt>Don't intentionally contradict established Broken Masquerade canon.</tt></li> <li><tt>When adding new entries, sort them chronologically.</tt></li> </ul> <p>Credits:</p> <ul> <li>Void CSS taken from <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/stormsite19">#stormsite19</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1586929224" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span> and slimmed down by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1586929224" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span>.</li> <li>Deer College profile pic is from <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/deer-college-hub">Deer College Student Study Handbook</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ch00bakka" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1238719&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1586929224" alt="ch00bakka" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1238719)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ch00bakka" >ch00bakka</a></span> and is modified from <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Complete_Guide_to_Heraldry_Fig390.png">this Project Guttenberg image</a>, public domain.</li> <li>bluntfiend profile pic is from <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/rainbow-crapitalism">More Like Rainbow Crapitalism</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ch00bakka" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1238719&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1586929224" alt="ch00bakka" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1238719)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ch00bakka" >ch00bakka</a></span>, and is sourced from <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:User_(89620)_-_The_Noun_Project.svg">here</a>, CC0.</li> <li>Rook's profile pic is from <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/parawatch-hub">Parawatch hub</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/natvoltaic" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2800867&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1586929224" alt="NatVoltaic" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2800867)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/natvoltaic" >NatVoltaic</a></span>, image by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3938622&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1586929224" alt="The Great Hippo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3938622)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" >The Great Hippo</a></span>.</li> <li>dado formatting is taken and modified from <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/your-very-last-scp">Your Very Last SCP!</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3938622&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1586929224" alt="The Great Hippo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3938622)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" >The Great Hippo</a></span>. Font used is Comic Neue via fontlibrary, SIL Open Font license.</li> <li>Rabbit icon used for PETA's Void profile is CC-BY-SA 3.0 Pere Igor and Honsvu and from <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.o